  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be three mutually perpendicular vectors of the same magnitude and equally inclined at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, with the vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Since, vectors are mutually perpendicular and of equally magnitude, hence let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>36</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
